  "2026-08-16T15:03:21.406Z","harness:codex","Review-fix evidence: CodeRabbit identified that the public facade leaked process.exitCode into embedding hosts. The facade now snapshots and restores the host exit state in a finally block. tests/unit/cli/public.spec.ts proves a successful --version call and an invalid-command call both preserve a pre-existing host exitCode. Repo-wide pnpm lint passed; full coverage passed 507 files / 7,414 tests at 100/100/100/100; packed npx smoke passed for 13 packages."
